      "content": "Dear Team, recognizing your right to hold personal political views, this memo establishes clear boundaries for professional communication platforms to ensure we maintain a cohesive and inclusive environment. While employees may discuss political issues socially, our internal channels like Slack and performance boards remain strictly work-focused to prevent division from impacting team collaboration. Please direct these discussions to external spaces or one-on-one conversations rather than broadcasting them within our public work forums. Your commitment to maintaining a unified, distraction-free workspace is essential for our continued success as we move forward.",
